3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.669
Rebuild the map patch by patch against

4
00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:13.939
a triangulation, then smooth the whole result.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.520
Claimed: settled in three dimensions, the open case.

6
